#: src/templates/resources-categories.html:9
msgid "Resource categories can be associated with a Resource or a Resource Template as a Category. They belong to a team and have two main properties: name and color. Examples: Equipment, Chemical, Cell line, Plasmid, Antibody, Microscope, etc..."
msgstr "資源類別可以作為類別與資源或資源模板關聯。它們隸屬於某個團隊，並具有兩個主要屬性：名稱和顏色。例如：設備、化學品、細胞株、質體、抗體、顯微鏡等。"

#: src/templates/resources-categories.html:11
msgid "No resource categories have been created in this team yet."
msgstr "此團隊尚未建立任何資源類別。"

#: src/templates/resources-categories.html:12
msgid "Create new resource category"
msgstr "建立新的資源類別"

#: src/templates/resources-status.html:9
msgid "Resource status can be associated with a Resource or a Resource Template. They belong to a team and have two main properties: name and color. Examples: In stock, Operational, Maintenance, Processed, etc..."
msgstr "資源狀態可以與資源或資源模板關聯。它們隸屬於某個團隊，並具有兩個主要屬性：名稱和顏色。例如：有庫存、運作中、維護中、已處理等。"

#: src/templates/resources-status.html:11
msgid "No resource status have been created in this team yet."
msgstr "此團隊尚未建立任何資源狀態。"

